<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <div n="4"><head><hi rendition="#g">Raphaels Stanze</hi>.</head><lb/>
<note place="left">Raphaels<lb/>
Stanze.</note><p>Unter die&#x017F;em Nahmen &#x017F;ind vier Zimmer bekannt,<lb/>
